  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Fresh, colorful, and light, these rolls are a healthy appetizer or snack you can make at home. Shrimp spring rolls are filled with plump shrimp, crisp vegetables, herbs, and rice noodles, all wrapped in delicate rice paper. Served with a sweet chili or peanut dipping sauce, they’re refreshing, gluten-free, and easy to customize with your favorite fillings. Shrimp spring rolls are perfect for summer gatherings, meal prep, or a quick, no-cook recipe that’s both healthy and delicious.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-shrimp-spring-rolls\">Why You’ll Love This shrimp spring rolls</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-shrimp-spring-rolls\">How to Make shrimp spring rolls</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-shrimp-spring-rolls\">Pro Tips for Making shrimp spring rolls</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-shrimp-spring-rolls\">How to Serve this shrimp spring rolls</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-shrimp-spring-rolls\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This shrimp spring rolls</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Fresh and vibrant flavors in every bite.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfect for a light meal or appetizer.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Customizable with your favorite veggies.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick and easy to prepare at home.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Healthy and low in calories!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-3392\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"3392\" data-servings=\"4\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wpr